window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A Broken Kingdom novella, a part of the Fox Fire trilogy.</p> <p>Five years since the realms were brought together. Three years of peace. The darkness the queen eradicated barely a whisper. But Malikye, General of the Shadows, feels an unease in the bridging kingdoms of Faedom.</p> <p>Malikye, General of her armies. Elijah, the royal guard to the queen, always acquaintances but nothing more until they cross paths on a night of feral desire.</p> <p>Chaos erupts when the Queen’s daughter is kidnapped. Malikye and Elijah rush to find the young princess before her absence is noticed.</p> <p>The clock is ticking, will Malikye and Elijah be able to rescue the princess and avoid the dangers of darkness still lurking within their realm, as something more than just lust blossoms between them.</p> <p><i>A Flicker in Shadow </i>is a feral love story between a \"too serious\" General and a spontaneous Royal Guard. This can be listened to as a standalone.</p>"; 
